  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched from an abandoned incubator in the ruins of Little Peep, Shade grew up scavenging for spare parts and DRIP. He honed his stealth skills in the shadow of the Flipper Kicks Dojo learning to strike from the darkness, always vigilant to survive.",
