    "name": "Shade",
    "personality": "Meticulous, Shade leaves no stone unturned in his quest for DRIP, planning every move with cold precision. Paranoid, Shade trusts no one, guarding his quackpack contents carefully, knowing that in Subchain City, betrayal is just a feather's breadth away. Focused, when Shade has his eyes set on a target, there is no stopping him.",
